  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **0 Is The One**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Tonight I'll Be Staying Here With You**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **I Could Never Take The Place Of Your Man**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2005-06-12.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 93 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer stood in the second row at the Bonnaroo set, which felt like it passed too quickly [2]\n- A man dressed as a conductor stood on a podium in front of the band and pretended to direct them [3]\n- Reviewer felt it was good but not quite as amazing as the band's Bonnaroo show the previous year [2]\n- The conductor gag mocked Trey's show the night before, where he brought a small orchestra playing string versions of songs [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2005-06-12.flac**: taped by Mark Lynn; transferred by Mark Lynn; source: FOB:DPA(B&K) 4011s->V2->AD2K->M1 [1]",
